  "aiContextParagraph": "The death of a 17-year-old student, identified as Silva Nur Intania Putri (SN), following an alleged physical assault in Malang has sparked widespread public and official concern. Authorities have identified several minors as Anak Berhadapan dengan Hukum (ABH), or children in conflict with the law, in connection to the incident. Public reaction led to significant unrest, with protesters gathering at the home of a suspect, causing property damage and injuring a local police chief. The Minister of Women's Empowerment and Child Protection has publicly condemned the violence, while members of the DPR are calling for a transparent legal process. Discussions have also emerged regarding the effectiveness of existing child protection regulations, with calls for legislative evaluation in light of the severity of the case. Police continue to maintain a heavy presence at the suspect's residence to prevent further escalations.",
